Defect: SMI-INVALID-DATE https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-invalid-date

LAST-UPDATED is written with a space inside the quotes, ahead of an
otherwise well-formed date. The repair removes the space.

No publisher on record serves this module, so the baseline is the text
this repository carried before the repair; which publication that was is
not recovered.

--- a/PKTC-ES-TAP-MIB
+++ b/PKTC-ES-TAP-MIB
@@ -27,7 +27,7 @@
 pktcESSupportMibs
 FROM CLAB-DEF-MIB;
 pktcESTapMib MODULE-IDENTITY
-LAST-UPDATED " 200604060000Z"
+LAST-UPDATED "200604060000Z"
 ORGANIZATION "PacketCable"
 CONTACT-INFO
 "Bernie McKibben
